   "description": "The finAPI mandator must be scoped to V2."
  },
  {
   "fieldname": "section_sandbox",
   "fieldtype": "Section Break",
   "label": "Sandbox Credentials",
   "description": "sandbox.finapi.io · webform-sandbox.finapi.io — free, meant for development. Two finAPI clients per environment. The DATA client handles users/banks/webforms; the ADMIN client is mandatorAdmin-only and optional (V1→V2 mandator switch). Using the wrong one returns 403."
  },
